 can Lisa have dinner today?</div>","choices":[{"id":18782,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> In the dining area</span>"},{"id":18783,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> In the restaurant</span>"},{"id":18784,"letter":"C.","html":"<span> In her room</span>"}]},{"id":10295,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>What time will Lisa check out tomorrow?</div>","choices":[{"id":18785,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> 12 pm</span>"},{"id":18786,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> 11 am</span>"},{"id":18787,"letter":"C.","html":"<span> Before 11 am</span>"}]},{"id":10296,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>What does Lisa ask the receptionist?</div>","choices":[{"id":18788,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> She asks her to wake her up tomorrow.</span>"},{"id":18789,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> She asks her for a phone charger.</span>"},{"id":18790,"letter":"C.","html":"<span> She asks her to let her charge her phone.</span>"}]},{"id":10297,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>What time does Lisa want to get up tomorrow?</div>","choices":[{"id":18791,"letter":"A.","html":"<span> 7:00 am</span>"},{"id":18792,"letter":"B.","html":"<span> 7:30 am</span>"},{"id":18793,"letter":"C.","html":"<span> 8:00 am</span>"}]}]}]}